<section class="section seo-copy"><div class="wrap compact-split"><h2>Custom cakes in Hyderabad, made around your celebration</h2><div><p>PureBakes is a premium custom cake studio in Hyderabad creating personalized, made-to-order cakes for birthdays, first birthdays, weddings, engagements, anniversaries, baby showers and milestone celebrations. Every design begins with the person and occasion—not a fixed catalogue.</p><p>Our cakes are available with egg or eggless. We serve celebrations across Hyderabad and can assist with arranging an Uber or another suitable cab when the cake and destination allow. Whether you found us while looking for customized cakes, a home baker near you, or an elegant designer cake, you’ll work directly with the studio to shape the details.</p><p>PureBakes is FSSAI registered. To secure a date, confirm your order with a 50% advance; the remaining balance is completed before pickup or before a delivery cab is booked.</p></div></div></section>
